  "info.maxplayers/minplayers/texmod/ranked on a copied map: no tool step; add gen op map-info {map, set{maxPlayers..}} writing map.info through patch-entity file:<key> rows",
  "info.mode.*: no tool outside misgen captureflag; same gen op map-info with a mode: field writing <mode>.info",
  "place.scale, place.tex, place.mods: in place-entity and gen place, missing in POST /api/x/maps/place; add body.scale, body.tex, body.mods to placeRoute",
  "place.remove (remove or move a placed object): no tool; add place-entity --remove <uid> / --move <uid> --pos and gen place.remove",
  "file.map.clips.* (border, camera, pather, zoom, tilt) of a copy: no tool; add gen op map-clip {map, clip, world|camera|pather|distance|viewAngle} (misgen already writes clip blocks)",
  "points.spawns and points.flags for combat and battle_zones: only misgen (captureflag) and mission-clone flag autoplace; add misgen modes combat/battle_zones (spawns per team, flags with zone) and a GUI form",
  "picture.preview/preview_small/minimap/header: no tool writes map DDS pictures; add an /art/icon-png style route map-picture {map, png, kind} that converts PNG to DDS into the map folder (minimap from mapview render)",
  "picture.layer and mapview --entities: CLI only; add ?layer=&entities=1 to GET /api/x/maps/picture",
  "make.* (mapgen): CLI only; add POST /api/x/maps/generate wrapping mapgen with the height/layers upload (task upload staging)",
  "copy.no_mission, copy.game_version, copy.no_modinfo: map-clone flags not passed by maps/clone; add body fields (low value)",
  "terrain.net/ply/mtl/grass/remap edits: no tool (editor hand-off only); keep as hand-off card, add remap.set rows to a gen set op file:<key> example",
